  "body": "## Changelog\n* bcead3a580e7b61e00b7046aa512558adbb94e9b Allow Postgres 18 in `fly mpg create` and default to 17 (#5445)\n* a70ceb7f9504ff07299014955f01dae6821671bf Show rootfs size in Machine status (#5522)\n* dcfa7c64e5d525679e9a4412852df5bd77b108ef Use one Machine for the image label preflight (#5538)\n* 109eb6454d6f4c97d94658165fb2365a554c2047 Bump fly-go to v0.12.7 (#5537)\n* be480c7dd76fe541aafd3de9ff71d81d1e875651 Add an AGENTS.md with build, test and contribution steps (#5536)\n* ecc3314f8dcf2f80cde3e527b36c68ddc26dd94d Bump fly-go to v0.12.6 (#5534)\n* 2d1b489134cb1dd00990b58d95896f2e5775387f Recover pushed images for buildpacks and nixpacks (#5531)\n* 9c7030760f633e16dc23f35e8ff9d64d05fc10c1 Deploy the pushed image when the builder loses its local copy (#5530)\n* a7faf138ecc74564c17d25a03de3c2bfe922ac93 Release partially acquired Machine leases when a deploy fails (#5529)\n* 6ec6e2c99443acb08d1a36f357d5f1961344f094 feat(mpg): support the Developer plan (#5484)\n* 00eb310a1dbbac8803b3b30aaf280108a9b4d41e Recognize local SQLite paths in DATABASE_URL (#5528)\n* 36700629b1c65c404d7d9d544548abcc9066b519 chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/mod from 0.42.0 to 0.43.0 in the golangx group across 1 directory (#5521)\n* bcfbf93d802856aa88a751c4fdde09e9a854758e chore(deps): bump github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go from 1.4.0 to 1.5.0 (#5412)\n* db36778c6deb1a6251c0f106b55850750cc2260b chore(deps): bump docker/login-action from 4.7.0 to 4.8.0 (#5435)\n* 21079afd25507ee83e5198239410e40231080665 chore(deps): bump rack from 3.2.6 to 3.2.8 in /test/preflight/fixtures/example-buildpack (#5423)\n* 8d90d6d9dc6d0215521b61d9b8165e2e476de95e chore(deps): bump github.com/depot/depot-go from 0.5.3 to 0.5.4 (#5422)\n* e1da360b42e71b6858ec03c11883a28b25dd6af3 chore(deps): bump github.com/containerd/containerd/v2 from 2.4.1 to 2.4.2 (#5505)\n* 375d0d1d4d7021f06a5e898954f02366613aae2c Wait for a newly created Machine to finish starting (#5526)\n* 2a30d9c01102d5805d48e35ed8a0b4df9c0e732f Create one machine for process groups without services (#5525)\n* b4d3626913e546d132655853595365fa1fa6a062 Show the right plan and ProdPack price after fly redis create (#5487)\n* c0b20343572e3f33de873f0299056526f63fec41 Bump fly-go to v0.12.3 to retry Machines API GETs on EOF (#5520)\n* e07c10cf3abc42eb511e60119f7b6196ccd6b563 Record organization lookup failures during image preparation (#5504)\n\n"
}
